# Icon.<NAME> declares extra icons under a resource name the program can look up at
# runtime, next to the Icon one the shell shows. All of them have to land in the one
# generated .rc: the resource compiler numbers each script's images from 1, so a
# second script holding an icon fails the link with CVT1100 duplicate resource.
# main.c looks all three up at runtime.
Assembly       NamedIconsTest
SourceFiles    main

Icon           app
Icon.GLFW_ICON app
Icon.TRAY_ICON app
